00:54:01.110 --> 00:54:05.180
Like what kind of
skills is activated,

00:54:05.180 --> 00:54:07.670
or in the last
turn, what happened,

00:54:07.670 --> 00:54:08.810
or something like that.

00:54:08.810 --> 00:54:09.362
Yeah.

00:54:09.362 --> 00:54:11.570
AUDIENCE: Are you at all
worried that the legacy data

00:54:11.570 --> 00:54:16.500
