00:54:16.500 --> 00:54:18.130
JUN: Um-- so sorry.

00:54:18.130 --> 00:54:20.300
I think I missed your point.

00:54:20.300 --> 00:54:21.110
AUDIENCE: Yes.

00:54:21.110 --> 00:54:22.830
As you introduce
more characters,

00:54:22.830 --> 00:54:24.950
more options,
this, that, are you

00:54:24.950 --> 00:54:27.710
worried that the
very old data that

00:54:27.710 --> 00:54:29.840
